A statue honouring Tiphaine Véron, the French tourist who vanished in Japan in 2018, was unveiled on Wednesday near the hotel where she was last seen. Eight years on and still without any solid leads, her family is now pushing for Japan's national police to take over the stalled investigation.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/1df91692-8b35-11f1-beef-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/Mother-of-Tiphaine-V%C3%A9ron-touches-commemorative-statue-of-her-by-Japanese-artist-Yokoi-Mana-29-July-2026-AFP-Andrew-Caballero-Reynolds.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/1df91692-8b35-11f1-beef-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/Mother-of-Tiphaine-V%C3%A9ron-touches-commemorative-statue-of-her-by-Japanese-artist-Yokoi-Mana-29-July-2026-AFP-Andrew-Caballero-Reynolds.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">72229e54-8b31-11f1-86df-f1977c9499c6</guid><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 12:50:33 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/1df91692-8b35-11f1-beef-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/Mother-of-Tiphaine-V%C3%A9ron-touches-commemorative-statue-of-her-by-Japanese-artist-Yokoi-Mana-29-July-2026-AFP-Andrew-Caballero-Reynolds.jpg">AFP - ANDREW CABALLERO-REYNOLDS</source><dc:creator>RFI</dc:creator></item><item><category>International</category><title>Zelensky hails ‘good meeting’ with Trump as Ukraine seeks Patriot missile deal</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/en/international/20260729-zelensky-hails-good-meeting-with-trump-as-ukraine-seeks-patriot-missile-deal</link><description>
